          up: {"title":"Correctly spaced or not? (Challenge)","intro":"<p>Go further than right or wrong: decide what KIND of spacing error each item has, if any. These come from a notice for Grenville Community Library.</p>","main":"Correct, extra space, or missing space?","bins":["Correct spacing","Error: an extra space","Error: a missing space"],"items":[{"t":"A well - known author will visit.","bin":1,"fb":"Extra spaces around the hyphen."},{"t":"The children's corner – newly painted – reopens soon.","bin":0,"fb":"Apostrophe tight; each dash spaced on both sides."},{"t":"Closed on public holidays !","bin":1,"fb":"Extra space before the exclamation mark."},{"t":"The librarian said, \"Please return books on time.\"","bin":0,"fb":"Comma, then one space, then quotation marks that hug the words."},{"t":"Story time (ages 4 to 8) on Saturdays","bin":0,"fb":"Brackets hug their text, with one space outside on each side."},{"t":"Opening hours: 9:00 am to 5:00 pm","bin":0,"fb":"Sentence colon spaced correctly; times closed up."},{"t":"Return it today.Fines start tomorrow.","bin":2,"fb":"Missing space after the full stop."},{"t":"Books,magazines and DVDs","bin":2,"fb":"Missing space after the comma."},{"t":"Ask at the desk(near the entrance).","bin":2,"fb":"Missing space before the opening bracket."},{"t":"Bring your card ; it is required.","bin":1,"fb":"Extra space before the semicolon."},{"t":"( Large-print books are on Shelf C )","bin":1,"fb":"Extra spaces just inside the brackets."},{"t":"Note:fines apply after 14 days.","bin":2,"fb":"Missing space after the colon."}],"win":"Excellent diagnosis. Knowing whether a space is extra or missing tells you exactly what to search for with Find and Replace."}
